### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- version: 1.6.0
-   READ-ONLY wine and alcohol search skill. Searches for wine information, ratings, and
-   price comparisons across platforms. Does NOT make purchases, process payments, or
-   modify any accounts. All operations are search and display only.
-   aged wines, identifying a wine from a label photo, or asking for purchase recommendations.
-     Optional. Firecrawl API key for accessing Vivino via US proxy. Used solely for
-     read-only wine search requests to api.firecrawl.dev. Scope is limited to search
-     queries only; no write/delete/account actions. Free tier: 500 requests/month.
-     Register at https://firecrawl.dev. Prefer environment variable over --firecrawl-key
-     to avoid exposing the key in shell history or process listings.
- - Year-specific buying advice when user specifies a vintage
- - Wine tips: drinking window advice based on vintage age and wine type, purchase recommendations
- | "Is this wine worth buying" | `python scripts/wine_search.py "<brand>" <year> --mode all` |
- | "Best platform to buy wine" | `python scripts/wine_search.py "<brand>" --mode price` |
-   - Year-specific buying advice when user specifies a vintage
- - Purchase recommendations
- - **READ-ONLY skill** -- This skill only searches and displays information. It does NOT make purchases, process payments, modify accounts, or perform any write operations. All platform links are for the user to open manually in a browser.
- - **Vintage recommendations with buying advice (v1.5)** -- The vintage comparison table now includes recommendation labels (Outstanding/Very Good/Good/Fair/Poor) and year-specific buying advice. When the user specifies a vintage, the script recommends whether to buy and suggests better alternatives if applicable.
